  "workflowCode": "ORA_CHANGE_ORDER_AUDITOR",
  "name": "Change Order Auditor",
  "description": "An AI-powered, user-configurable audit system that parses human-defined rules (from Excel or Word), creates specialized validation agents, and orchestrates REST APIs to check for compliance issues in real time. When discrepancies are found, the system proposes or executes corrective actions with human review before advancing workflow stages.",
